# Challenge template library: the code (src/, build scripts) is in git; the ~1,000 images and PPTX files
# that build.mjs makes are not (rebuild them with `node build.mjs`). Raw footage and finished exports
# are backed up in OneDrive "Scrolly Media", not here.
automation/k1-launch/content/library/dist/
automation/k1-launch/content/library/node_modules/

# Halloween pack: zips made for upload (rebuild from the buyer folders)
automation/reel-template-pack/halloween/for-upload/

# Template pack: cut-out cache made by build/storyboard_b2.py (rebuilt from assets/props/source)
automation/reel-template-pack/build/.cache/
automation/youtube/.cache/
# Physical pack: zips made for upload (rebuild from the buyer folders)
automation/reel-template-pack/for-upload/

